Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.84,0:01:16.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:23.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(我们对你失去亲人深表遗憾)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:44.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:39.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这附近的行尸比以前要多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more of them around here than there used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:44.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不知道是否有人… - 嘘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't know if any people are... - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:46.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:49.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾登想从一只行尸嘴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aiden was trying to save us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:51.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救出我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a roamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:55.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对它开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shooting at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后格伦让他分心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then Glenn distracted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:03.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了手榴弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw the grenades.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:09.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:13.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想跑 我不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wanted to just go, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was gonna run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:17.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想丢下他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't gonna leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:19.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Tara?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.91,0:06:21.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想丢下她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't gonna leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:23.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们逼他留了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we made him stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:29.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人帮忙的话 救不出艾登\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't get Aiden out of there without help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:32.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们进入大厅时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then when we got into the lobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:34.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只用抵住门就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All he had to do was hold the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:36.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他敲打着玻璃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was hitting on the glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,推开我的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pushing my door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:39.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:42.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他惊慌失措了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:44.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者说他们想杀我 也许他们压根不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or they were trying to. Or they just didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:46.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚 我抓住他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah, I had him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:49.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抓住他的手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:53.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不往回推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I didn't push back,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:55.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be dead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:06:59.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:07.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我眼睁睁看着他死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watched him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:15.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他们干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:16.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:19.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你们一起回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you all came back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:21.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:24.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈 你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.31,0:07:27.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我稍后要看录像 我们现在就得拍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need it for later. We have to do this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:37.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许带枪 不许出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No guns. No going outside the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:40.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦也是 直到我调查清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same goes for Glenn until I finish looking into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:41.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要调查什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you need to look into?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:43.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都跟你说了事情的经过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I'm telling you how it went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人必须离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:47.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们跟我们不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are not like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:50.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你也看出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you see it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.52,0:07:52.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我看到了什么 尼古拉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what I see, Nicholas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:55.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I see a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:07.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我差点就把他留在那里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost left him out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:09.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以编个故事糊弄过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could have told a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:14.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 你觉得我应该那样做吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you think I should have?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:18.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不知道自己在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't know what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:20.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有一个人知道 - 我们可以教他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any of them. - We'll show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:24.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他们能不能看清现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if they can see it. How things really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.89,0:08:26.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他们能不能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if they can yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:27.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还没有认清事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They haven't caught up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:28.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们必须留下 - 没错 我们必须\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to. - Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:36.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们的规矩 我们不必遵守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But their rules, we don't answer to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:38.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是他们 瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are them, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:41.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:47.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚 他对这里很有信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah, he believed in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:52.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你 我们必须在这里好好生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, we gotta make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:31.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我送了烤面到迪安娜家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sent a casserole to Deanna's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:34.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要让她看到我们的关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want her to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:38.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想过皮特吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you thought about Pete?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.71,0:09:40.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我说的那件事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:43.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.59,0:09:47.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又和山姆谈了谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talked to Sam some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:53.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他妈妈在壁橱里安了插销\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said his mom put a bolt on the inside of his closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时她会叫他把自己锁在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tells him to lock himself in sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:58.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到早上才能出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not come out till morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.33,0:10:02.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他能听见他爸在吼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he can hear his dad yelling,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:05.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摔东西 他妈妈在哭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}things breaking, his mom crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:09.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上个月有一次忽然没声了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last month it got quiet right in the middle of it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:11.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走出去发现妈妈躺在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he went out and found her on the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:15.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昏迷了 流着血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unconscious, bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:20.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮特坐在门廊上无动于衷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete was just sitting on the porch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么关心杰茜的遭遇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you care what happens to Jessie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:29.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道原因的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我知道你为什么关心她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know why you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:38.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见过你和她聊天的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen you talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:52.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如行尸没有杀死爱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If walkers hadn't gotten Ed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:55.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就不会站在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't be standing here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.31,0:11:01.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:43.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.91,0:11:49.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 伙计？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:14.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:17.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.49,0:12:18.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:42.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:48.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 她怎样了？- 稳定下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How is she? - Stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.27,0:13:52.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撑着呢 我一会儿回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hanging on. I'm gonna go back there later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:56.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得萨沙可能在哨塔里过了夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Sasha might have spent the night in the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:58.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还在上面吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she still up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:13:59.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是亚伯拉罕在值班 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abraham's on watch now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:02.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没回来 没人见过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she hasn't been back and nobody's seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:13.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:16.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉你的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She told you about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:18.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一天我见到她拿着步枪出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw her going out one day with her rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:21.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道已经有人放哨了 我问了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew somebody was already in the tower. I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.73,0:14:45.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们来这里之后我第一次出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the first time I've been out since we've been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:46.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经感觉到不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It already feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:51.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:54.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:00.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After Eugene,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:03.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金说谎之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after finding out he lied,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:05.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感到很迷惘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was screwed up
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.31,0:15:07.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我失去了希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I lost something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:13.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你似乎因为找到了希望而迷惘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem screwed up because we found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.39,0:15:17.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:20.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.31,0:15:27.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里我仿佛一直在沉睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just feel like I was asleep in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:30.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在努力忘掉过去 重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were trying to forget so you could try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:33.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不想忘掉过去 - 那就别忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't want to forget. - So don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:35.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这不意味着你要放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that doesn't mean you have to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:38.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有带上你的刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't bring your sword with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:41.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这已经能说明问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,节哀顺变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:06.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:10.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.69,0:16:16.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该处理一下皮特的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a problem with Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为状况会好转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hoped it'd get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:26.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:32.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,状况并没好转 以后也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hasn't gotten better. It won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮特是外科医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete's a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:37.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他救了很多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's saved lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:39.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也可能救下塔拉的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He might be saving Tara's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:41.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在对妻子施暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's beating his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.09,0:16:44.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们必须制止他 - 怎么制止？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to stop it. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:46.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们让他们分居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We separate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:48.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他必须遵守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tell him that's how it'll be from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:50.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他不愿意 你会怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens when he doesn't want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.21,0:16:57.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not his choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:02.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:07.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:09.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能随便杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.98,0:17:15.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是文明社会 瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is civilization, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:18.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警告别人住手 否则就得死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning someone to stop or die,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:20.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才是如今的文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is civilized nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:23.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢？我们就放任他施暴吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what? So we just let him hit her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.09,0:17:24.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他弄死她吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We let him kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.57,0:17:28.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 如果真那样 我们就流放他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we exile him if it comes to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:30.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那么做 我们不知道他什么时候会摸回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do that, we don't know when he comes back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.24,0:17:31.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会做出什么事来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what he does to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:33.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放走他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letting him go
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:35.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会让这里岌岌可危\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}makes this place vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.17,0:17:37.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想等到塔哨上的警卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really want to wait till someone in that tower
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:38.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不得不出手的时候吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has to take care of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:40.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那还得是我们走运的情况下 - 我们不会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And that's if we're lucky. - We are not...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:43.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,处死任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}executing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:46.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再提这种建议了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ever suggest it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:51.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种想法不允许存在于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sort of thinking doesn't belong in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:54.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在出人命是家常便饭 迪安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People die now, Deanna. They do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.81,0:17:58.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这种危急时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's times like this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:18:00.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以决定谁死 什么时候死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can decide who and when.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:03.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则别人可能会替你做决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or it can be decided for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:06.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经有人替我做过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It already was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:10.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换做你 我也不会杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:14.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会流放你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd just send you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:27.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从后脑击穿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it in the back of the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:28.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had to be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:42.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back of the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:51.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在猎捕它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's hunting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.95,0:19:14.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:18.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在跟踪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:20.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.19,0:19:22.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你方向错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're going the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你早知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:27.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你动静太大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're very loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:32.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能回去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:35.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话 你吓到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be honest, you scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:37.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该自己溜出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't sneak out by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.65,0:19:40.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚死了两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two people just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.41,0:19:42.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:47.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有人会死的 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People always die. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:50.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.43,0:19:51.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.19,0:19:56.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底跑这来干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you do out here anyways?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:20:00.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same thing as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:17.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼古拉斯 什么也别说 听着就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicholas, don't talk, just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:20.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那次外出时送命的四个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those four people you lost on that run,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:21.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都归咎于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而诺亚的死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Noah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.69,0:21:26.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's on you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:28.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那五条人命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those five lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.17,0:21:30.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你造的孽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have to carry that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:35.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这样的人 早该死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People like you are supposed to be dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.97,0:21:38.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但幸好这些墙及时建起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but these walls went up just in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:39.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你还没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:44.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不准再踏出墙外半步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't go outside those walls anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:49.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准单独出去 也不准跟任何人出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not by yourself, not with anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:52.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你才能活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's how you're gonna survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:54.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈以为你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.41,0:21:58.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是一个了解你本性的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm someone who knows who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.83,0:22:01.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你做过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:04.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再让这种事发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's not gonna happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:06.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直尽心尽力保护这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been protecting this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.91,0:22:09.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮忙供给 而你才刚来而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}helping provide for it. You just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.55,0:22:13.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了我刚说过的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:16.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在威胁我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you threatening me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:18.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:21.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是在救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:45.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就该待在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're supposed to be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.73,0:22:49.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就该拥有这种感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're supposed to feel like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.79,0:22:54.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想忘记这种感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.51,0:23:02.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奔跑 让我感觉好过些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And .. running makes me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:05.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:08.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会梦到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dream about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.21,0:23:12.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟它们一起置身于森林之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being in the forest with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.56,0:23:17.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.85,0:23:24.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗恩是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ron's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:27.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.99,0:23:31.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道你跑出来了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he know you come out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.46,0:23:32.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.81,0:23:34.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会理解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:41.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么会怕我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.84,0:23:44.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道 就是怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. You just do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:50.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.49,0:23:54.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾是我妈的刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was my mom's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.63,0:24:01.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在到达那里之前 经历了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you before you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.57,0:24:05.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那重要吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.03,0:24:08.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要 我懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It does. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.33,0:24:11.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也经历过一些可怕的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something bad has happened to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:22.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了 听起来有很多行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to go. Sounds like a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.26,0:24:38.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是它们的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's their world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.05,0:24:41.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是活在其中而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just living in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.96,0:25:07.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.28,0:25:10.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也怕我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're afraid of me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.59,0:26:30.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.60,0:26:34.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.66,0:26:35.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.59,0:26:38.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了被动防守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sick of playing defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.19,0:26:41.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你要主动干掉它们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're just gonna take on all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.49,0:26:42.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.14,0:26:59.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.17,0:27:01.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们走吧 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh..You do, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.51,0:27:25.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不需要你的帮助 - 不是为了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't need your help. - This isn't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.65,0:28:12.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己能行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.45,0:28:14.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.33,0:28:24.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都让你们走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.61,0:28:33.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.94,0:28:36.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都做不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.90,0:28:39.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你挺适应这一切的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worked out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.22,0:28:41.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没发现吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.43,0:28:46.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.66,0:28:48.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.14,0:29:02.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.87,0:29:06.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过他他活不下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him he wouldn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.64,0:30:18.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行凶者把剩下的躯体带走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever did this took what was left with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.89,0:30:24.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是刚发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.95,0:31:16.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她被绑了起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.29,0:31:19.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他们吃了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they fed on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.01,0:31:23.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撕裂她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tore her apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.15,0:31:28.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是刚发生的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.89,0:31:31.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.41,0:31:37.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.43,0:32:02.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.23,0:32:10.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让罗恩和山姆知道我抽烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want Ron and Sam to know about those.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.63,0:32:13.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会保密的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your secret's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.01,0:32:19.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚是个好孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah was a sweet kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.23,0:32:28.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是塔拉 皮特把她照顾得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Tara, she's... she's in good hands with Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.49,0:32:30.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他打了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hitting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.40,0:32:35.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他伤害了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hurting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.76,0:32:40.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这必须停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.78,0:32:48.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 会停止的 - 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It will. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.36,0:32:52.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他以前经历过一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are things in his life that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.18,0:32:53.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.67,0:32:57.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 以前也是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it was like this before
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:32:59.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他后来听劝改了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he got help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.40,0:33:01.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我劝他改了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I helped him
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.23,0:33:03.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况后来变得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and things were good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.11,0:33:08.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以处理好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.33,0:33:11.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你做不到 但我可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you can't. But I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.30,0:33:15.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你能做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, what... what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.19,0:33:17.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么做 要把他关进监狱吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do? You gonna put him in jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.81,0:33:21.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只会把情况搞得更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're only gonna make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.46,0:33:25.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果情况恶化 那意味着他已经杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's gotten worse, it means he's killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.32,0:33:27.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是接下来会发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.82,0:33:30.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让那种事发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.93,0:33:37.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么会在乎？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.99,0:33:46.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这事对你那么重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is this so important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.95,0:33:51.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在 你好不容易安定下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now? You've made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.48,0:33:53.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为你的孩子们找到了一个家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a home for your kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.38,0:33:57.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克 你到底想干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.89,0:33:59.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想帮忙而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.27,0:34:00.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看未必\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.80,0:34:06.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm married.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.31,0:34:12.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗？我可以管好自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.92,0:34:16.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都得管好自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to take care of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.01,0:35:19.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.99,0:35:23.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道山姆找人要枪了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know Sam asked for a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.28,0:35:25.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.51,0:35:31.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该来这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.78,0:35:34.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰茜 在这里 你看不清状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jessie, in here, you can't see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.34,0:35:35.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但其实是一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.70,0:35:37.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实跟外面的世界是一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the same as out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.77,0:35:39.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有食物吃 有房子住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have food and roofs over our heads,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.97,0:35:41.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不能苟且偷生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you don't get to just live.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.98,0:35:45.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能忍气吞声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't get to put it off
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.01,0:35:46.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是祈祷一切好转 杰茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or wish it away, Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.47,0:35:49.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不抗争 你就会死掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't fight, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.25,0:35:55.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.04,0:35:59.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望你死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't want you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.03,0:36:05.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can... I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.60,0:36:09.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以保障你和孩子们的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can keep you and your boys safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.75,0:36:14.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.85,0:36:20.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只需要点头答应就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to do is say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.51,0:36:31.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会为别人做这种事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you do this for someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.81,0:36:37.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换做是别人 你还愿意这么做吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you do this for anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.29,0:36:50.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.73,0:36:57.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.83,0:37:02.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.84,0:37:07.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.34,0:37:11.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.84,0:37:14.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.84,0:37:20.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 听我说 - 我得请你走人了 瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Listen to me. - I'm gonna have to ask you to leave, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.29,0:37:26.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.91,0:37:32.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.05,0:37:38.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该离开的人是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.09,0:37:42.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在胡说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.02,0:37:45.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 皮特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.08,0:37:50.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们刚刚谈了些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you been saying to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.51,0:37:54.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个干了什么好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you been doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:57.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮特 我们都出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete, you and me are gonna leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.59,0:37:59.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跑到我家来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come into my house...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.08,0:38:01.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮特 我们出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete, you and me are leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.50,0:38:03.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该出去的人是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're leaving right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.86,0:38:05.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你代表了法律吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're the law?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.77,0:38:08.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为这里轮得到你做主吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You actually think you have a say in anything here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.61,0:38:11.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 退后 - 你以为你是谁啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Step back. - Who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.17,0:38:12.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在忍着不杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone who's trying not to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.74,0:38:13.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.30,0:38:16.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.49,0:38:21.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敢跑进我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come into my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.18,0:38:23.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 皮特 住手 - 这是我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pete, stop it! - It's my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.51,0:38:24.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮特 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.98,0:38:30.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.41,0:38:59.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.54,0:39:38.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸 别打了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.57,0:39:57.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.31,0:40:00.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.85,0:40:05.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再敢碰他们 我就杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You touch them again and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.14,0:40:07.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死 瑞克 我说了停手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Rick! I said stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.52,0:40:10.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.53,0:40:13.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要赶我走吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna kick me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.40,0:40:18.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪 瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put that gun down, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.72,0:40:27.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.11,0:40:31.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.49,0:40:39.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道该怎么做 我们从不迟疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know what needs to be done and we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.85,0:40:44.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the ones who live.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.08,0:40:54.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们只会呆坐着 定计划和犹豫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, you just sit and plan and hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.48,0:40:58.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们装作什么都懂 其实什么也不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pretend like you know when you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.08,0:41:06.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们只会希望世界不是这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wish things weren't what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.88,0:41:09.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想活下去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you want to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.76,0:41:13.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想让这地方维持下去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want this place to stay standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.12,0:41:17.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们那套结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your way of doing things is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.93,0:41:22.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不是想想就会变好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things don't get better because you... you want them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.52,0:41:26.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从现在开始 我们必须\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starting right now, we have to live
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.56,0:41:28.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活在现实中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.89,0:41:33.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须审核谁能待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to control who lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.83,0:41:38.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在非常清楚谁能待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's never been more clear to me than it is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.83,0:41:40.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吗？你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? Me? You...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.90,0:41:43.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean... you mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.58,0:41:49.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的方法会毁掉这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your way is gonna destroy this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.15,0:41:51.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会害死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna get people killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.55,0:41:54.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经害死人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's already gotten people killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.76,0:41:57.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能坐视不理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna stand by and let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.54,0:42:00.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不抗争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.36,0:42:01.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.54,0:42:03.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能袖手旁观…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna stand by...
